    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Dwarf</em></p><p>You have the blood of dwarf heroes flowing through your veins. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Increase your Constitution score by 1, to a max of 20.</p></li><li><p>Whenever you take the Dodge action in combat, you can spend one Hit Die to heal yourself. Roll the die, add your Constitution modifier, and regain a number of hit points equal to the total (minimum of 1).</p></li></ul>",
